Third-party data included in this repository:

1. reference/nomenclator/*.xls[x] — annexes of "Clasificația indicatorilor
   privind finanțele publice", approved by Ordinul MFP nr. 1954/16.12.2005,
   as published by the Romanian Ministry of Finance at
   https://mfinante.gov.ro/domenii/buget/clasificatiile-bugetare
   The published annexes state that they do not constitute legal basis
   ("nu reprezintă temei legal"). Refresh with `bgconvertor nomenclator update`.

2. data/<year>/**/budget_file.pdf — official local-government budget
   documents (HCL annexes), public administrative records published by the
   respective municipalities. Per-file sources and retrieval dates are in
   data/<year>/manifest.json and data/<year>/SOURCES.md.

3. SIRUTA territorial codes — Institutul Național de Statistică,
   https://data.gov.ro/dataset/siruta-2025
